{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Archetypal Destroyer stands out with its exceptional gameplay system, which combines two genres: first-person shooter and tower defense. The gameplay is enriched by a spectacular destruction mechanism, enabling the demolition of environmental elements, including even text (yes, that's not a mistake\u2014you can destroy text too). The player's objective is to stop enemies from reaching the final point. In addition to conventional weapons, the player has defensive towers at their disposal, allowing for strategic control of the battlefield.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3615760?t=1744184211","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3615760?t=1744184211","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615760/e0fd5e1b0bf28f6c2d4d2c9b491cf06a02ffaafe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744184211","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615760/e0fd5e1b0bf28f6c2d4d2c9b491cf06a02ffaafe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744184211","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Archetypal Destroyer stands out with its exceptional gameplay system, which combines two genres: first-person shooter and tower defense. The gameplay is enriched by a spectacular destruction mechanism, enabling the demolition of environmental elements, including even text (yes, that's not a mistake\u2014you can destroy text too). The player's objective is to stop enemies from reaching the final point. In addition to conventional weapons, the player has defensive towers at their disposal, allowing for strategic control of the battlefield.</p>","developers":["WAWRO"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"I